# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Jumper release signing — TEMPLATE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Copy this file to `keystore.properties` (same directory).
# 2. Fill in the real values below.
# 3. NEVER commit `keystore.properties` or the .keystore file (already
